    "stagger": "Reveal (measured on develop, quarry, stratus, ai): the first column starts at 0ms, the second at 200ms. Inside the text column each direct item steps 100ms (eyebrow, h2, the *:mb-6 wrapper, the button row); inside the wrapper the paragraphs / list step 100ms from the wrapper, each <li> 100ms from its list, each button 100ms from its row. The image column wraps the <img> in an animated div at the column's delay; the video poster column has no inner target. default:  img col 0 > div 0 > img 0 | text 200: eyebrow 200, h2 300, wrap 400 (p 400/500), buttons 500 textLeft: text 0: h2 0, wrap 100 (p 100, ul 200, li 200/300/400), buttons 200 (a 200/300) | img 200 T12-T13 additions (specs/T12-T13.md B \"N-split additions\"): - `cols` = left/right widths at >=1024: '6/6' (default), '7/5', '5/7', '7/4' (media at col 9) - `poster` puts a 16:9 video poster in the media column of any variant - paragraphs may be rich: an array of strings and { b } (bold) / { a, to } (link) runs; every run, text runs included (as <span>s), fades in its own step: run j at paragraph + 100j (lattice-certification) - bullets may carry a bold lead-in: { lead, text } -> <strong> at the <li>'s delay, <span> text +100 - `plainBody`: the paragraphs inside the *:mb-6 wrapper are not animated themselves (certification video split: only the wrapper fades) - `pt0` for the second and later rows of a run of splits | reveal targets with inline delays, see src/components/DiagramSection.jsx:6-37"
  },
